<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Thursday show that net currency reserves fell to about 104.2 billion marks in the week ending December 23 from about 106.1 billion in the previous week.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Dec 23	  Dec 15</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     120.7	   122.1</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   16.5	    16.0</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
